UnitPaymentHubAuthorization
└── when anyone submits an authorization
    ├── given a valid EOA signature before the deadline
    │   └── it sets the budget, increments the nonce and emits AuthorizationSet
    ├── given a valid signature that replaces an earlier budget
    │   └── it replaces the budget with the new value
    ├── given the deadline equals the current timestamp
    │   └── it sets the budget
    ├── given a contract wallet that approves the digest
    │   └── it sets the budget
    ├── given a contract wallet that rejects the digest
    │   └── it reverts with PaymentHub_InvalidSignature
    ├── given a signature by another account
    │   └── it reverts with PaymentHub_InvalidSignature
    ├── given a signature that was already used
    │   └── it reverts with InvalidAccountNonce and keeps the budget
    ├── given a nonce that is not the current one
    │   └── it reverts with InvalidAccountNonce
    ├── given a signature past its deadline
    │   └── it reverts with PaymentHub_SignatureExpired
    ├── given a signature for another chain id
    │   └── it reverts with PaymentHub_InvalidSignature
    └── given a signature for another hub address
        └── it reverts with PaymentHub_InvalidSignature
